- Increment a draft revision.
- Revalidate the entire document unnecessarily.
- Refetch products.
- Recreate the PageRenderer.
- Restart videos.
- Reinitialize Three.js scenes.

Selection is editor UI state, not a document modification.

## 56. Use efficient geometry updates

